    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flammĭger</span></b> , gĕra,
			gĕrum, adj.
		flamma + gero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>flame-bearing</i>, <i>flaming</i>,
				<i>fiery</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ales,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the eagle</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 8, 676</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sol,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 5, 582</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Titan,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					1, 415</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zona,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Idyll. 4, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
